### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Register New User & Workspace
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "workspaceName": "Doe Properties"
}

### Automatically capture variables from the registration response above
@authToken = {{registerUser.response.body.token}}
@workspaceId = {{registerUser.response.body.activeWorkspace.id}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Login Existing User
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Get Current User Profile & Workspaces (Protected Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
x-account-id: {{workspaceId}}